title: The right-click menu over a file, a folder, the root folder, empty canvas, and at the edges of the window stays inside it; a zoom, a drag, Escape and a key that moves the canvas close it
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left none
right none
fit
wait 1000
menu 640 400
wait 500
mark on-file
wait 500
menu 860 500
wait 500
mark on-folder
wait 500
menu 1080 500
wait 500
mark on-root-folder
wait 500
menu 300 500
wait 500
mark on-empty
wait 500
menu 1690 880
wait 500
mark bottom-right
wait 500
menu 1100 890
wait 500
mark bottom
wait 500
menu 1700 60
wait 500
mark top-right
wait 500
menu 60 890
wait 500
mark bottom-left
wait 500
zoom 1.5
wait 600
mark after-zoom
wait 500
menu 640 400
wait 400
drag 300 300 420 380
wait 600
mark after-drag
wait 500
menu 640 400
wait 400
press escape
wait 500
mark after-key-escape
wait 500
menu 640 400
wait 400
press +
wait 700
mark after-zoom-by-key
wait 500
menu 640 400
wait 400
press left
wait 700
mark after-move-by-key
wait 500
quit
